    "name": "Ashfall council hearing",
    "summary": "Kael brings a disputed logbook to the council at Cinder Bay. Three approaches reconverge on the council response. Register ashfall_file_record in Preview to simulate the clerk.",
    "beats": [
      {
        "id": "00000000000000000000000002",
